B.bNW=new A.iy(!1,"Tap a blue surface: a whole wall or the ceiling. The finishing is done on a whole surface at a time.",D.ek)
B.bNX=new A.iy(!0,"The cable starts at the breaker panel. Tap the box it must reach.",D.ek)
B.bNY=new A.iy(!0,y.m,D.ek)
B.bNZ=new A.iy(!0,"The breaker is OFF, so the switch does nothing yet. Turn the breaker on.",D.ek)
B.bO_=new A.iy(!0,"Hole drilled straight up through the top plate. This is where a cable goes up into the ceiling.",D.ek)
B.bO0=new A.iy(!0,"Unplugged.",D.ek)
B.bO1=new A.iy(!0,"Outlet box nailed to the side of the stud, 16 inches up to its middle (the usual height), with its front level with the wood so the drywall will fit. Next, break a knockout in it.",D.ek)
B.bO2=new A.iy(!0,"Plugged in. Nothing happens because the breaker is off.",D.ek)
B.apU=new A.iy(!0,"The cable will start at the breaker panel. Tap the box it must reach, then the knockout it goes in through.",D.ek)
B.bO3=new A.iy(!0,y.q,D.ek)
B.bO4=new A.iy(!0,"Cable pulled back out of the box (and the cables that went on from it).",D.ek)
B.bO5=new A.iy(!0,"Sanded smooth with the pole sander until you cannot feel the joints. Wipe the dust off, then prime.",D.ek)
B.bO6=new A.iy(!0,"Hole drilled through the middle of the stud, 20 inches up. It is 3/4 inch wide and well away from both edges, so the stud stays strong and a nail cannot reach the cable.",D.ek)
B.bO7=new A.iy(!0,"Plugged in and running.",D.ek)
B.bO8=new A.iy(!0,"Breaker ON. There is nothing to test yet: wire a device in a box first.",D.ek)
B.bO9=new A.iy(!0,"Paper tape pressed into the wet mud over every seam and in every corner, and the extra mud scraped off flat. Let it dry.",D.ek)
B.bOa=new A.iy(!0,"Ceiling box hung on the joist, level with the bottom of the board. Break a knockout in it for the cable, then the light hangs from it.",D.ek)
B.bOb=new A.iy(!0,"Metal corner bead nailed round the opening. It protects the sharp corner and gives the mud a straight edge to finish against.",D.ek)
B.apV=new A.iy(!0,"The cable ends in this box, but its wires are not connected yet: the power stops here. Put a device in it (Outlets or Switches in the tray), tap the device and join each wire to its screw. Then the cable can go on from here. (Tap the box again to pull this cable out.)",D.ek)
